---

Treasury

Current Treasury Size: $1.21 billion (per 31 Mei 2025); sumber lain menyebut $1.3B+

Treasury Composition:

· Native Token Holdings: ~93% of treasury in ARB (sekitar 2.7 billion tokens, valued north of $500M)
· ETH Exposure: ~9,000 ETH, accumulated from fees and deployments
· Stablecoin Holdings: USDC/USDT via STEP programs; small in size today
· Other Assets - RWAs: $27.6 million in RWA holdings (USD) as of May 31, 2025; total RWA investments reached 85 million ARB across STEP programs; ~$35 million in tokenized U.S. Treasuries through Franklin Templeton

Treasury Custodian: DAO Treasury adalah smart contract yang dikelola langsung oleh ArbitrumDAO melalui on-chain voting. Treasury Governor menangani distribusi dana dari DAO Treasury.

Sources:

· https://messari.io/
· https://www.kucoin.com/news/insight/ARB/69462f6ced5e01000738363f
· https://forum.arbitrum.foundation
· https://docs.arbitrum.foundation

---

Revenue Model

Protocol Fees (L2 Base Fee & L2 Surplus Fee)

· Status: Live
· Deskripsi: L2 Base Fee membayar minimum L2 gas price (0.1 gwei di Arbitrum One, 0.01 gwei di Arbitrum Nova). L2 Surplus Fee dikenakan saat chain mengalami congestion. 100% of fees collected on Arbitrum One itself go to the Arbitrum treasury.
· Sources:
  · https://docs.arbitrum.foundation
  · https://docs.arbitrum.io/launch-arbitrum-chain/configure-your-chain/common/aep-fees/calculate-aep-fees

Arbitrum Expansion Program (AEP) License Fees

· Status: Live
· Deskripsi: Arbitrum Chains deployed outside of Arbitrum One and Arbitrum Nova must pay 10% of their Protocol Net Revenue to the Arbitrum Foundation. Net Protocol Revenue = gross revenue minus settlement costs.
· Sources:
  · https://docs.arbitrum.io/launch-arbitrum-chain/chain-config/costs/aep-overview
  · https://docs.arbitrum.io/launch-arbitrum-chain/configure-your-chain/common/aep-fees/calculate-aep-fees
  · https://docs.arbitrum.foundation

Robinhood Chain Fee Share

· Status: Live (mulai Juli 2026)
· Deskripsi: 10% of net protocol revenue from Robinhood Chain flows to ecosystem: 8% to Arbitrum DAO treasury, 2% to Arbitrum Developer Guild.
· Sources:
  · https://www.kucoin.com/news/flash/arbitrum-locks-in-revenue-from-robinhood-chain-fees

Bridge Fees

· Status: Live
· Deskripsi: Revenue earned through fees on top of the bridge.
· Sources:
  · https://docs.arbitrum.io/launch-arbitrum-chain/configure-your-chain/common/aep-fees/calculate-aep-fees

