RINGKASAN

· Total Funding Raised: $143.7 million (Seed $3.7M + Series A $20M + Series B $120M) — belum termasuk Coinbase Ventures investment yang jumlahnya tidak diungkap
· Funding Rounds: 4 (Seed, Coinbase Ventures, Series A, Series B)
· Treasury Status: $1.21B–$1.3B+ (per 2025), didominasi ARB (~93%) dengan diversifikasi ke ETH, stablecoin, dan RWA
· Revenue Sources: Protocol fees (L2 base/surplus), AEP license fees (10% of net protocol revenue from external chains), bridge fees, Robinhood Chain fee share
· Revenue Availability: Data real-time tersedia via DefiLlama dan Token Terminal; laporan keuangan rinci tidak diungkap secara publik

